# Stock report format

Every report in `analysis/` must follow `methodology/09-report-format.md` exactly.

- Read `methodology/09-report-format.md` before writing; copy its §5 skeleton.
- Keep every section and its number; write `不適用：原因` instead of deleting a section.
- Fill all 14 scores in §3, or mark `未評估` and list it under `本次未驗證 / 待補`.
- Amounts in NT$億, dates in YYYY-MM-DD.
- Run the §6 self-check before finishing.
